    "teach_6": {
      "id": "teach_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The base can be the unknown too.\n\nlog_x 16 = 4\nmeans\nx^4 = 16.\n\nWith the chapter's positive-base rule, x=2.",
